While the Huntik team explored [[Tír na nÓg]], the full moon shed a ray of light which triggered a vortex that absorbed [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Cherit]], leading them to the inter-dimensional world. 

There, Lok was able to talk with his father [[Eathon Lambert]], who was trapped in the [[Spirit World|Spirit World.]] He was also able to contact the spirit of [[Casterwill|Lord Casterwill]], which allowed him to bond with [[Pendragon]]. The only known way to exit this world was with the help of [[Umbra]], the [[Legendary Titans|legendary Titan]] of dimensions. {{source|Back Home}} 
